<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA OFFERS TWO DISCOUNT T-BILL ISSUES TUESDAY.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA OFFERS TWO DISCOUNT T-BILL ISSUES TUESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will</p>
<p>offer two issues of discount T-bills with no par value set in</p>
<p>advance and maturities of one week and four weeks respectively</p>
<p>at auctions on Tuesday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	 BG 3011697003	BG3011797001</p>
<p> Auction date	 January 21, 1996   January 21, 1997</p>
<p> Issue date	   January 21, 1997   January 21, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date	January 28, 1997   February 18, 1997</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
